  "description": "Two weeks after the disaster at the Global Science Base in Antarctica. The US national research icebreaker 'Pontus' carried eight survivors of the science base disaster: Donghwan Cha, Sayaka, Nozomi, Ri Meirin, Wang Gaochang, Lee Sang-hyun, Kim Kyung-han, and Jeong Se- in, along with the only surviving infected person, Cheon Ki-wook, while heading for the Pacific Ocean while heading for the New York Harbor. Another terrible tragedy begins in the middle.\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
